msgctxt "92"
msgid ""
"We're done with work. Let's go to one of those Okinawan hostess clubs I've "
"heard so much about!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "I haven't seen any around here, though. Have you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"Come to think of it, I haven't either. Wonder where the red light district "
"is..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"Gentlemen! You two looking for a hostess club!? Then, you need to get "
"yourselves over to Hatsumachi!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid "Hatsumachi? Where's that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid ""
"Just head north up Kitaryu Street and cross over the Kubochi River. It's a "
"short walk from here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid ""
"In fact, I happen to know of a great club up that way. Would you like me to "
"take you? The girls there are the absolute best!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid "Really? That sounds great! Please, lead the way!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid ""
"Excellent, I'll bring my car around. Wait right here. I'll be back in just "
"a minute!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid ""
"I can't believe he's gonna drive us there. People in Okinawa sure are "
"friendly!"
msgstr ""

